{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/589909-clues-as-to-what-happens-to-a-wraith-after-it-transcends","id":589909,"title":"Clues as to what happens to a Wraith after it Transcends?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-13T22:25:54-07:00","id":589909,"title":"Clues as to what happens to a Wraith after it Transcends?","content":"Has there been any hints as to what becomes of a Wraith after Transcenedence? Do they go to someplace in the High or Deep Umbra? Do they reincarnate, or just become one with the universe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T04:32:34-07:00","id":590141,"title":"","content":"It's left open what happens. About all that can be said is that it's a permanent way out of the Underworld.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T09:45:18-07:00","id":590270,"title":"","content":"It would probably depend on the Storyteller's take on the nature of the cosmos. Might be going to Heaven (whichever variety one subscribes to), achieving Nirvana, being reincarnated, one with the universe, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T09:47:24-07:00","id":590271,"title":"","content":"I have opinion that they either pass on to Lethe and they get reincarnated (the Exalted theory), or perhaps going from Demon's mythos, these are the human souls taken for whatever planned new Creation that God was building up to (The whole reason Charon the Fallen Angel set up Haven was to keep human dead souls about and within reality). Of course it's mentioned here and there that Oblivion is just a passive way of wiping away the old so the new can blossom in it's place... Plus Charon went through Oblivion in WW2 and ended up being reincarnated in the Skinlands after he Fettered himself to them, so who really knows?<br /> <br /> Let it also be said that Cartharsis and Harrowings were both originally ways to let a wraith let go of their earthly lives before they were to pass on in peace, before the methods were corrupted to be the terrors they are today, which is probably more on the Neverborn than Oblivion itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T20:07:14-07:00","id":590744,"title":"","content":"Officially, they end. Call it what you like - moving up or on, traveling to another dimension, etc. - but they have passed beyond the World of Darkness and its myriad realms. Evidence seems to point that they find peace, though, so there's that.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T06:51:15-07:00","id":591225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/589909-clues-as-to-what-happens-to-a-wraith-after-it-transcends?p=590271#post590271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Plus Charon went through Oblivion in WW2 and ended up being reincarnated in the Skinlands after he Fettered himself to them, so who really knows?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is never specifically stated what Charon specifically went through. All we know is he created a whirlpool that pulled him and Gorool into the Sunless Sea. It seems unlikely that Oblivion was his gateway to a new life.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T09:23:15-07:00","id":595702,"title":"","content":"Well after a Harrowing you end up at your nearest Fetter and Charon fettered himself to the Skinlands as a whole, so I assumed it had something to do with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}